<ContentLayout title="Terms of Service | TokenCalculator.dev" description="Terms and accuracy limitations for TokenCalculator.dev." heading="Terms of service"><p>TokenCalculator.dev is an open-web utility provided for planning and informational use without warranties.</p><h2>Calculation accuracy</h2><p>Provider tokenizers, model behavior, limits, and prices can change. Exact badges apply only to the raw text and tokenizer shown; API wrappers, tools, system instructions, and provider processing can add tokens.</p><h2>Pricing accuracy</h2><p>Live and fallback pricing data can be delayed or incomplete. Verify material spending decisions against official provider documentation and actual API usage records.</p></ContentLayout>
